ution; no hidden additional AI casts or overlapping special resolves."}, tags = {}, roles = {"tank", "healer", "damage", "everyone"}}}, sections = {{title = "Entry", paragraphs = {"The raid leader asks Veyla, Witness of the Uncounted, outside Vex Thal's entrance in public Umbral Plains. Twelve to thirty-six active seasonal characters of level 55 or higher need personal and server Luclin access. Combat is tuned for twenty-four to thirty-six level-60 characters."}, bullets = {}}, {title = "Wipes and return", paragraphs = {}, bullets = {"A wipe resets the unfinished encounter after ten seconds without a living engaged member in its arena. Completed encounters remain defeated.", "Follow named landmarks and text countdowns. Check every character's floor and position; pets and dead characters do not count for player assignments.", "Return to the existing expedition through its guide or DZ Manager. Original instance and replay deadlines continue; returning does not create a new copy."}}}},
  ["vex-thal-stolen-names-thall-va-kelun"] = {overview = {"Follow the named landmarks and the full text countdowns. Finish the current assignment before taking another.", "After an assignment resolves, allow at least 10 seconds of recovery. Scheduled routine pulses wait through assignments and recovery, then restart their full interval."}, roles = {{id = "tank", label = "Tanks", tips = {"Gather threshold witnesses while holding Kelun."}}, {id = "healer", label = "Healers", tips = {"Cover the announced waxing period and add tank."}}, {id = "damage", label = "Damage dealers", tips = {"Control or kill the conduit."}}, {id = "everyone", label = "Everyone", tips = {"One group decision handles each period; no individual moon-color reaction."}}}, phases = {{label = "Waxing and Waning", trigger = "Every 45 seconds", description = "One 45000 HP conduit begins a 15 second waxing period. While free it supplies 15% boss melee and 600 base cold pulse per 12 seconds. Root/mez/stun suppress both and cancel a pending pulse."}, {label = "The Moon Takes a Witness", trigger = "60% and 25% health", description = "Two 25000 HP lunar witnesses join normal combat. They allow ordinary crowd control. Next waxing waits until at most 1 survives."}, {label = "Routine pressure and support", trigger = "Throughout the encounter", description = "Routine pulse: 500 base cold damage, three-second cast every 30 seconds; first after full interval. Cancel/defer through major warnings/impacts and ten-second recovery, then restart full interval; no catch-up. Shared supports: level 62, AC 400, ATK 150, melee 100-300 every three seconds, 0% slow mitigation, ordinary root/mez/stun/slow. No-melee actors and named melee overrides below replace this range. Protected fixed landmarks:1 HP, untargetable, no melee/casts. Waxing Conduit 45,000 HP, maximum 1, melee 0-0: No melee; 600-base cold pulse at twelve seconds, then every twelve while free. Root/mez/stun suppress and cancel pending pulse. Despawn when fifteen-second waxing ends. Lunar Witness 25,000 HP, maximum 2, melee 90-260: Normal melee and ordinary control, no spells. Major threshold attacks queue behind the current assignment. Support deadlines begin after validated same-floor spawn. Support casts pause during major impacts and ten-second recovery."}}, abilities = {{name = "Waxing and Waning", summary = "Every 45 seconds", description = {"One 45000 HP conduit begins a 15 second waxing period. While free it supplies 15% boss melee and 600 base cold pulse per 12 seconds. Root/mez/stun suppress both and cancel a pending pulse.", "Success: Kill the conduit to end waxing, or control it until waning.", "Failure: Free conduit sustains its temporary bonus; no permanent stack."}, tags = {}, roles = {"tank", "healer", "damage", "everyone"}}, {name = "The Moon Takes a Witness", summary = "60% and 25% health", description = {"Two 25000 HP lunar witnesses join normal combat. They allow ordinary crowd control. Next waxing waits until at most 1 survives.", "Success: Tank/control adds and choose their kill order.", "Failure: Ordinary additional melee; no simultaneous kill requirement."}, tags = {}, roles = {"tank", "healer", "damage", "everyone"}}, {name = "Routine pressure and support", summary = "Throughout the encounter", description = {"Routine pulse: 500 base cold damage, three-second cast every 30 seconds; first after full interval. Cancel/defer through major warnings/impacts and ten-second recovery, then restart full interval; no catch-up. Shared supports: level 62, AC 400, ATK 150, melee 100-300 every three seconds, 0% slow mitigation, ordinary root/mez/stun/slow. No-melee actors and named melee overrides below replace this range. Protected fixed landmarks:1 HP, untargetable, no melee/casts. Waxing Conduit 45,000 HP, maximum 1, melee 0-0: No melee; 600-base cold pulse at twelve seconds, then every twelve while free. Root/mez/stun suppress and cancel pending pulse. Despawn when fifteen-second waxing ends. Lunar Witness 25,000 HP, maximum 2, melee 90-260: Normal melee and ordinary control, no spells. Major threshold attacks queue behind the current assignment. Support deadlines begin after validated same-floor spawn. Support casts pause during major impacts and ten-second recovery.", "Success: Use the stated control/interrupt response and recover for eight seconds after each major impact.", "Failure: Uncontrolled supports retain only their listed contribution; no hidden additional AI casts or overlapping special resolves."}, tags = {}, roles = {"tank", "healer", "damage", "everyone"}}}, sections = {{title = "Entry", paragraphs = {"The raid leader asks Veyla, Witness of the Uncounted, outside Vex Thal's entrance in public Umbral Plains. Twelve to thirty-six active seasonal characters of level 55 or higher need personal and server Luclin access. Combat is tuned for twenty-four to thirty-six level-60 characters."}, bullets = {}}, {title = "Wipes and return", paragraphs = {}, bullets = {"A wipe resets the unfinished encounter after ten seconds without a living engaged member in its arena. Completed encounters remain defeated.", "Follow named landmarks and text countdowns. Check every character's floor and position; pets and dead characters do not count for player assignments.", "Return to the existing expedition through its guide or DZ Manager. Original instance and replay deadlines continue; returning does not create a new copy."}}}},
  ["vex-thal-stolen-names-thall-xundraux-diabo"] = {overview = {"Follow the named landmarks and the full text countdowns. Finish the current assignment before taking another.", "After an assignment resolves, allow at least 10 seconds of recovery. Scheduled routine pulses wait through assignments and recovery, then restart their full interval."}, roles = {{id = "tank", label = "Tanks", tips = {"Gather shieldbearer and call an order."}}, {id = "healer", label = "Healers", tips = {"Prepare for the role chosen to die last."}}, {id = "damage", label = "Damage dealers", tips = {"Choose last role deliberately; interrupt remembered casts."}}, {id = "everyone", label = "Everyone", tips = {"The raid creates its own later assignment through kill order."}}}, phases = {{label = "A Battle That Was Not Yours", trigger = "75% and 40% health", description = "Shieldbearer 35,000 HP, healer 25,000 HP and arcanist 25,000 HP appear; one set maximum, ordinary crowd control. Shieldbearer melee 120-340 every three seconds. Healer uses an interruptible three-second 2% boss-heal; arcanist an interruptible three-second 650-base magic cast. Both begin six seconds after spawn and repeat every twelve seconds between starts while free. Controlled actors stop contributing. Boss remains damageable."}, {label = "Recall the Defeat", trigger = "Every 40 seconds after a set dies", description = "Last role killed becomes the later memory: shieldbearer 10% melee for 15 seconds; healer 2% self-heal channel; arcanist 650 base magic channel. Each is announced 12 seconds."}, {label = "Routine pressure and support", trigger = "Throughout the encounter", description = "Routine pulse: 550 base magic damage, three-second cast every 30 seconds; first after full interval. Cancel/defer through major warnings/impacts and ten-second recovery, then restart full interval; no catch-up. Shared supports: level 62, AC 400, ATK 150, melee 100-300 every three seconds, 0% slow mitigation, ordinary root/mez/stun/slow. No-melee