", "everyone"}}, {name = "Routine pressure and support", summary = "Throughout the encounter", description = {"Routine pulse: 550 base magic damage, three-second cast every 30 seconds; first after full interval. Cancel/defer through major warnings/impacts and ten-second recovery, then restart full interval; no catch-up. Shared supports: level 62, AC 400, ATK 150, melee 100-300 every three seconds, 0% slow mitigation, ordinary root/mez/stun/slow. No-melee actors and named melee overrides below replace this range. Protected fixed landmarks:1 HP, untargetable, no melee/casts. Borrowed Shieldbearer 35,000 HP, maximum 1, melee 120-340: Normal melee, no spells. Borrowed Healer 25,000 HP, maximum 1, melee 0-0: Interruptible three-second 2% boss-heal cast begins six seconds after spawn, then every twelve seconds between cast starts while free. Borrowed Arcanist 25,000 HP, maximum 1, melee 0-0: Interruptible three-second 650-base magic cast begins six seconds after spawn, then every twelve seconds between cast starts while free. Major threshold attacks queue behind the current assignment. Support deadlines begin after validated same-floor spawn. Support casts pause during major impacts and ten-second recovery.", "Success: Use the stated control/interrupt response and recover for eight seconds after each major impact.", "Failure: Uncontrolled supports retain only their listed contribution; no hidden additional AI casts or overlapping special resolves."}, tags = {}, roles = {"tank", "healer", "damage", "everyone"}}}, sections = {{title = "Entry", paragraphs = {"The raid leader asks Veyla, Witness of the Uncounted, outside Vex Thal's entrance in public Umbral Plains. Twelve to thirty-six active seasonal characters of level 55 or higher need personal and server Luclin access. Combat is tuned for twenty-four to thirty-six level-60 characters."}, bullets = {}}, {title = "Wipes and return", paragraphs = {}, bullets = {"A wipe resets the unfinished encounter after ten seconds without a living engaged member in its arena. Completed encounters remain defeated.", "Follow named landmarks and text countdowns. Check every character's floor and position; pets and dead characters do not count for player assignments.", "Return to the existing expedition through its guide or DZ Manager. Original instance and replay deadlines continue; returning does not create a new copy."}}}},
