 during major impacts and ten-second recovery.", "Success: Use the stated control/interrupt response and recover for eight seconds after each major impact.", "Failure: Uncontrolled supports retain only their listed contribution; no hidden additional AI casts or overlapping special resolves."}, tags = {}, roles = {"tank", "healer", "damage", "everyone"}}}, sections = {{title = "Entry", paragraphs = {"The raid leader asks Veyla, Witness of the Uncounted, outside Vex Thal's entrance in public Umbral Plains. Twelve to thirty-six active seasonal characters of level 55 or higher need personal and server Luclin access. Combat is tuned for twenty-four to thirty-six level-60 characters."}, bullets = {}}, {title = "Wipes and return", paragraphs = {}, bullets = {"A wipe resets the unfinished encounter after ten seconds without a living engaged member in its arena. Completed encounters remain defeated.", "Follow named landmarks and text countdowns. Check every character's floor and position; pets and dead characters do not count for player assignments.", "Return to the existing expedition through its guide or DZ Manager. Original instance and replay deadlines continue; returning does not create a new copy."}}}},
  ["vex-thal-stolen-names-va-dyn-khar"] = {overview = {"Follow the named landmarks and the full text countdowns. Finish the current assignment before taking another.", "After an assignment resolves, allow at least 10 seconds of recovery. Scheduled routine pulses wait through assignments and recovery, then restart their full interval."}, roles = {{id = "tank", label = "Tanks", tips = {"Hold the registrar near the called Witness and face him away."}}, {id = "healer", label = "Healers", tips = {"Cover certification pulses and announced melee penalties."}}, {id = "damage", label = "Damage dealers", tips = {"Kill the exact named clerk."}}, {id = "everyone", label = "Everyone", tips = {"Text names carry every instruction; no color identification required."}}}, phases = {{label = "The Counterfeit Census", trigger = "Every 40 combat seconds", description = "Three 25,000-HP attackable clerks appear, each level 62/AC 400/ATK 150, melee 100-300 every three seconds, ordinary root/mez/stun/slow. The full text call identifies the active collector. Twelve seconds later that collector attempts certification; all clerks despawn after resolution. Census waves never overlap."}, {label = "An Empty Entry", trigger = "70% and 35% health", description = "The tank receives a visible entry and a named Witness appears at a fixed tank-side landmark; twelve seconds to bring the boss within 25 paces."}, {label = "Routine pressure and support", trigger = "Throughout the encounter", description = "Routine pulse: 500 base magic damage, three-second cast every 30 seconds; first after full interval. Cancel/defer through major warnings/impacts and ten-second recovery, then restart full interval; no catch-up. Shared supports: level 62, AC 400, ATK 150, melee 100-300 every three seconds, 0% slow mitigation, ordinary root/mez/stun/slow. No-melee actors and named melee overrides below replace this range. Protected fixed landmarks:1 HP, untargetable, no melee/casts. Census Clerk 25,000 HP, maximum 3, mele