 3, melee 100-300: Only the full-name matching collector certifies after twelve seconds; all clerks despawn after resolution. Major threshold attacks queue behind the current assignment. Support deadlines begin after validated same-floor spawn. Support casts pause during major impacts and ten-second recovery.", "Success: Use the stated control/interrupt response and recover for eight seconds after each major impact.", "Failure: Uncontrolled supports retain only their listed contribution; no hidden additional AI casts or overlapping special resolves."}, tags = {}, roles = {"tank", "healer", "damage", "everyone"}}}, sections = {{title = "Entry", paragraphs = {"The raid leader asks Veyla, Witness of the Uncounted, outside Vex Thal's entrance in public Umbral Plains. Twelve to thirty-six active seasonal characters of level 55 or higher need personal and server Luclin access. Combat is tuned for twenty-four to thirty-six level-60 characters."}, bullets = {}}, {title = "Wipes and return", paragraphs = {}, bullets = {"A wipe resets the unfinished encounter after ten seconds without a living engaged member in its arena. Completed encounters remain defeated.", "Follow named landmarks and text countdowns. Check every character's floor and position; pets and dead characters do not count for player assignments.", "Return to the existing expedition through its guide or DZ Manager. Original instance and replay deadlines continue; returning does not create a new copy."}}}},
